{"id": 994846, "slug": "dungeons-and-ducklings", "name": "Dungeons and Ducklings", "name_original": "Dungeons and Ducklings", "description": "<p><strong>~ Baby ducklings have been kidnapped, and you are a very angry Mama Duck.</strong></p><p>This is a QuackMan Roguelite. Battle the evil Lich and his undead minions to rescue your ducklings. Classic PacMan controls but with an added ATTACK button that can destroy walls and vanquish enemies. </p><p> </p> <strong>Gameplay:</strong> <p>Play as Mama Duck and navigate your way through the evil Lich's dungeon maze. Rescue your lost ducklings and form a giant chain of ducks. You must battle waves of undead minions. In this adorable QuackMan Roguelite, you can customize Mama Duck with hundreds of different gear combinations. Your gear gives unique active and passive abilities. They are also adorable accessories, so you can fashion up your duck.  </p><p> </p><p> <strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul><li><p>   Destroy walls and make your own path through the maze!</p></li><li><p>   Battle massive bosses and fight back a wide variety of undead minions. </p></li><li><p>   Make animal friends, like the shop cat at Toe Beans Cafe.</p></li><li><p>  Meta upgrades and progression.</p></li><li><p>   FASHION DUCKS! Hundreds of gear combinations for Mama Duck </p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-12-16", "tba": false, "updated": "2024-12-20T06:41:38", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/99a/99aacf72d4640d707b6df703bc11a64e.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/b6c/b6c4af81bfa76d0f5b021943c5b62076.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 6, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", 